vastation that's on it's way to Earth.\n\n**Battle endless alien ships and creatures in this epic shooter from Brow Of The Hill.**\n\n**Test your battle skills in Arcade Mode and get yourself on the international Leaderboard of best fighters.**\n\n**Multiple weapons drops throughout the game.**\n\n**Campaign Mode coming July 2026**\n\nThe Draxx are coming! Only you can stop them.\n", "short_description": "A space marine stationed on the moon at a secret weapons testing base is the only one who stands between Earth and an alien invasion. Can you stop the Alien Hordes before they reach Earth ?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.browofthehill.co.uk/privacy-policy-ah", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Brow Of The Hill", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.browofthehill.co.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26708585522102653"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1679001016469807"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27132519049733138"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "27132519049733138"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1782752400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27132519049733138"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_suppor